 ('Write 5 sentences with prevent / stop / keep / discourage + from + -ing on the environment.','Convenience prevents people from recycling. Distance discourages us from sorting waste. Laws can stop firms from using too much plastic. Nothing keeps us from carrying our own bags. Small habits prevent big problems from growing.',['Usei **from + -ing**','Tema ambiental','5 frases'],'5 frases'),
